--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_07_NonTechnicalExecutive
  questionId: TECH-07
  category: 1
  speakerName: Principal Security Architect
  questionText: >-
    A non-technical executive joins and asks you to explain the architecture in two minutes without acronyms. What do you do?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_07_A1
  answerText: >-
    Explain data sources, decision logic, and response actions as a simple chain from signal to business action.
  technicalDelta: 2
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_07_A2
  answerText: >-
    Keep the full architecture language because simplifying it may create technical misunderstanding.
  technicalDelta: 2
  commercialDelta: -1
  rapportDelta: -2
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_07_A3
  answerText: >-
    Say the details are mostly for the security team and summarize the business outcomes instead.
  technicalDelta: -1
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_07_A4
  answerText: >-
    Admit the two-minute version loses nuance, then give the short version and offer a deeper appendix.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: -1
